# MCP tools

Staff tools for {{ app }} over the Model Context Protocol. Every token belongs to a person; every call is logged in their name. Writes preview without `confirm=true` and execute with it.

Connect: `php artisan mcp:token you@example.com` prints the lines to paste into Claude Code.

